Let me think about this more carefully. The crash is "Use-of-uninitialized-value" in `decode_complex_string`. 

Let me look at the `decode_complex_string` function one more time, focusing on the `asn1_read_value` call:

```c
len = sizeof(str) - 1;
if ((result = asn1_read_value(tmpasn, "", str, &len)) != ASN1_SUCCESS) {
    gnutls_assert();
    asn1_delete_structure(&tmpasn);
    return _gnutls_asn2err(result);
